#: ../../source/developer_guide/integration.rst:2
msgid "Integration"
msgstr "集成"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/integration.rst:4
msgid ""
"LMCache acts as a caching middleware that sits between LLM inference "
"engines and storage systems, enabling:"
msgstr "LMCache 作为缓存中间件，位于 LLM 推理引擎和存储系统之间，提供："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/integration.rst:6
msgid ""
"**Transparent Cache Reuse**: Automatic detection and reuse of previously "
"computed KV caches"
msgstr "**透明缓存重用**：自动检测并重用之前计算的 KV 缓存"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/integration.rst:7
msgid ""
"**Performance Optimization**: 3×–10× reduction in time-to-first-token "
"(TTFT) for multi-round conversation and RAG."
msgstr "**性能优化**：在多轮对话和 RAG 场景下，首个 token 时间（TTFT）减少 3×–10×"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/integration.rst:8
msgid "**Resource Efficiency**: Significant GPU cycle savings through cache reuse"
msgstr "**资源效率**：通过缓存重用显著节省 GPU 周期"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/integration.rst:9
msgid ""
"**Scalable Architecture**: Support for single-node and multi-node "
"deployments"
msgstr "**可扩展架构**：支持单节点和多节点部署"

