#: ../../source/developer_guide/integration.rst:21
msgid "Integration with vLLM"
msgstr "与 vLLM 集成"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/integration.rst:23
msgid ""
"When LMCache is integrated with vLLM, the inference pipeline is augmented"
" to lookup and inject cached KV chunks for any reused input content. The "
"sequence diagram below shows how a prompt request flows through vLLM with"
" LMCache:"
msgstr "当 LMCache 与 vLLM 集成时，推理管道会增强，以查找并注入用于任何重用输入内容的缓存 KV 块。下面的时序图显示了提示请求如何在带有 LMCache 的 vLLM 中流动："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/integration.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Cache Lookup**: Upon receiving a new prompt, vLLM (via the LMCache "
"connector) computes identifiers (e.g. hashes of token sequences) and "
"queries LMCache for matching KV cache chunks. If a cache hit occurs, "
"LMCache retrieves the KV chunk (potentially from CPU or disk) and returns"
" it to vLLM. vLLM then injects these KV tensors into the model's "
"attention cache instead of recomputing them from scratch."
msgstr "**缓存查找**：在接收到新提示时，vLLM（通过 LMCache 连接器）计算标识符（例如 token 序列的哈希值）并查询 LMCache 以获取匹配的 KV 缓存块。如果发生缓存命中，LMCache 检索 KV 块（可能来自 CPU 或磁盘）并将其返回给 vLLM。然后 vLLM 将这些 KV 张量注入模型的注意力缓存中，而不是从头重新计算它们。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/integration.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Inference with Cache**: vLLM proceeds with inference. For any parts of "
"the prompt where no cache was available (cache miss), the model computes "
"new KV values as usual. Cached segments (e.g. previously seen text) are "
"skipped in computation, significantly reducing the time-to-first-token "
"(TTFT) and saving GPU cycles."
msgstr "**带缓存的推理**：vLLM 继续进行推理。对于提示中没有可用缓存的任何部分（缓存未命中），模型会像往常一样计算新的 KV 值。已缓存的段（例如之前看到的文本）在计算中会被跳过，从而显著减少首个 token 时间（TTFT）并节省 GPU 周期。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/integration.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Async Cache Write**: After processing the prompt, any newly generated "
"KV cache chunks (corresponding to this prompt's content) are handed off "
"to LMCache for storage. This put operation is done asynchronously (in the"
" background) so it doesn't delay the response. The response is returned "
"to the user promptly, and LMCache's background tasks will offload the new"
" KV data to CPU, disk, or other backends for future reuse."
msgstr "**异步缓存写入**：处理提示后，任何新生成的 KV 缓存块（对应于此提示的内容）都会交给 LMCache 进行存储。此 put 操作是异步完成的（在后台），因此不会延迟响应。响应会迅速返回给用户，LMCache 的后台任务会将新的 KV 数据卸载到 CPU、磁盘或其他后端以供将来重用。"

